{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"c303f3cff994766c","type":"text","text":"After the fall, you feel like you are in a completely different place, the air around you feels warmer, more welcoming. \nYou look upwards and the rupture where you fell from is no longer there.\nIn front of you lays a wooden door with some light coming from the small gaps between the frame","x":60,"y":-332,"width":647,"height":162},
		{"id":"5af5117df3c4033e","type":"text","text":"After fall","x":-340,"y":-281,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"702d6d521f5cb7d7","type":"text","text":"You open the door, the light coming from inside blinds you. It takes a moment for you to gather your senses. When you do you notice you are inside the tavern, people talking mugs clashing and the fireplace cracking. You hear an old dwarf call you","x":60,"y":-66,"width":647,"height":126},
		{"id":"9999fb20529e412a","type":"text","text":"Open door","x":-340,"y":-33,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"c50369557fb1b20e","type":"text","text":"[[Barkeeper (Thorf Widehook)]] Greeting","x":-340,"y":300,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"70633ee92d5b05ef","type":"text","text":"- Come in, come in! Welcome to the Sleepy Mug! My my, you look like trampled rabbit. What happened to you lot?\n- You know what, me pa always told me to be kind to wanderers. You need not to worry about anything tonight, you may pass the night here, on the house. \n- (BRENNA PREPARE THA ROOMS WE HAVE GUESTS)\n- You must be thirsty here, enjoy the best flagon in the realm! (heal 2d4 + 2)\n- What do ya think?\n","x":60,"y":220,"width":647,"height":221},
		{"id":"c33808579b72c7df","type":"text","text":"Answer questions","x":820,"y":220,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"0daec57688cdafda","type":"text","text":"On whats outside\n- There are some guards patrolling the lands, and there is talk of a nasty bandit gang causing ruckus, but fortunately it hasnt hit my door  ","x":1280,"y":-60,"width":375,"height":160},
		{"id":"e7fafb9cc1744db7","type":"text","text":"Send them off","x":820,"y":360,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"3fb7cdc198b2c384","type":"text","text":" Well lads choose any table!  I be with a in a minute with some bites to eat, make yourselves at home. ","x":780,"y":560,"width":331,"height":120},
		{"id":"9d4d514a14820e2c","type":"text","text":"Arth\nPart of [[Seraphim the lost]] party now working in guard duty","x":457,"y":960,"width":250,"height":120},
		{"id":"8b5690990ae9b6a9","type":"text","text":"\n- (Look at [[Seraphim the lost]]) You look like you have seen some battlefields eh?\n- Those days are long before me, now theres is only guard duty trying to keep the few lands we still have\n- But i believe he will return and things will turn back to its glory days. Going from battle to battle conquering new lands. Gaining fame and glory to our names!\n- But now we dont even have good men. All we have left are untrained men forced into duty by the king, how the mighty have fallen","x":880,"y":890,"width":780,"height":260},
		{"id":"f0afa8fa72f7f368","type":"text","text":"- Honestly id give anything not to deal with the bloodthirsty gang.\n- Ever since that heist no one wants to deal with them. They released a bear into the town. A FUCKING BEAR. And those two that managed to escape, burning half the town in the process? Who knows whats their next plan?","x":880,"y":1280,"width":780,"height":160},
		{"id":"d57eecc6f09802cc","type":"text","text":"I think they dwell in the dark arts of summoning spirits to control people to do their nasty works. To this day i cant unseee that room, all the blood, his screams... How could someone murder a woman and a child in cold blood and just stand there? It must be supernatural ","x":880,"y":1531,"width":780,"height":149},
		{"id":"ca21ec94d7012eaa","x":1840,"y":1520,"width":780,"height":149,"type":"text","text":"- Was patrolling the forest, passed an old hunters hut where I heard screams coming from inside. \n- Went for a look just to find a bloodied room, a woman and a child laid on the floor and a man screaming his guts out. \n- I tried to put the man down but all happened so fast, he threw me off the ground and ran away. \n- We tried looking for him to no avail  "},
		{"id":"f365510b583db5bb","type":"text","text":"if they ask about the heist\n- A few years ago, they planed an heist to the towns treasure and for a distraction they decided to lure a bear into town to spread chaos. \n- In the end their plan turned against them the bear hindered their escape somehow and left a nasty scar in one of them. \n- We captured them, to no avail they managed to get free and blow up half the town in the process...","x":1820,"y":1280,"width":780,"height":180},
		{"id":"ac307866a6c2ea27","type":"text","text":"Varden\nCity guard that dealt with [[Revenant gang]] ","x":457,"y":1315,"width":250,"height":90},
		{"id":"2fee9e5a58f9e03c","type":"text","text":"Darian\nPatrol that found [[Nikolai Oak]]","x":457,"y":1563,"width":250,"height":86},
		{"id":"9322a993ff785f69","type":"text","text":"Next to your table you see 3 soldiers wearing a red tabbard","x":60,"y":1306,"width":250,"height":109},
		{"id":"69a2cf8e050ab651","type":"text","text":"[[Soldiers]]","x":-340,"y":1331,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"31cd568eef15ff2d","x":-340,"y":1860,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"[[Barkeeper (Thorf Widehook)]] comes back"},
		{"id":"5f5d0f49ab24d1ab","x":80,"y":1860,"width":820,"height":260,"type":"text","text":"- Sorry for the wait lads, Busy day. I hope it quenches ya hunger (he hands you platters filled with meats, grilled fish and many kinds of cheese)\n- Oh i almost forgot, ya r"}
	],
